    "https://ewal.fa.us8.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/12126": {
      "title": "Chief Application & Analytics Officer (Finance) - Finance Strategy & Operations",
      "description": "The Chief Application & Analytics Officer (CAAO) serves as the senior leader responsible for overseeing the full lifecycle of Finance & Administration’s enterprise applications and for advancing the use of data analytics to generate actionable insights. The CAAO leads the team that implements, optimizes, and sustains critical technology solutions that support operational excellence across the institution. The role is primarily focused on leading and managing a team responsible for application configuration, system integration, troubleshooting and issue resolution, security and role administration, and the ongoing maintenance of third-party and enterprise systems including Oracle Fusion Cloud Financials. The CAAO ensures that applications function cohesively and that the data they produce is reliable, accessible, and aligned with business needs. ",
      "department": null
    },
