    "https://ewal.fa.us8.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_1/job/12431": {
      "title": "Assistant Clinical Professor - School of Human Sciences",
      "description": "Texas Woman’s University’s online master’s program in Child Life is one of only a few in the country, and one of only two in the state of Texas. In addition, we also offer a bachelor’s degree in Child Development with an emphasis in Child Life. Both degree options meet the academic eligibility requirements for certification through and are endorsed by the Association of Child Life Professionals. ",
