      "description": "The Woodcock Institute for the Advancement of Neurocognitive Research and Applied Practice is committed to the interdisciplinary advancement of contemporary cognitive assessment and applying evidence-based research to clinical practice. The Woodcock Institute supports interdisciplinary research into the cognitive profiles of individuals with diagnosed exceptionalities (e.g., learning disabilities, neuropsychological conditions, behavioral and psychiatric disorders, and giftedness).",
